window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Homecoming is the time of the year for alumni to bask in the glory of their college years. For Tony and Emya, this homecoming is so much different. Muted emotions and attraction for one another are finding their voice, and once the words are released, they can’t be taken back. Can the mystic aura of homecoming last long after the stadium lights are turned out?</p>"; 
